{"seq":6,"slug":"new-media","title":"网络与新媒体","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media","introMarkdown":"# 网络与新媒体\n\n我决定认真研究新媒体，是因为有一天我突然意识到：我每天醒来第一件事是刷手机，睡前最后一件事还是刷手机，但我完全不知道屏幕另一端发生了什么。是谁决定了我看到这条视频而不是那条？为什么我关注的博主突然\"没流量\"了？一个普通人发的内容，凭什么能在几小时内被几百万人看到？\n\n这些问题听起来像是行业八卦，但当我开始拆解它们，才发现背后是一整套可以被理解、被学习、甚至被运用的知识体系。网络与新媒体不是\"会拍视频、会写文案\"那么简单，它横跨技术、内容、传播、商业和数据，是一门典型的交叉学科。\n\n我把自学的路径整理成了四个章节，顺序大致是\"从认识到上手，再到看懂规则、看透底层\"。\n\n第一章先把地基打好：到底什么是新媒体，它和报纸电视这些传统媒体有什么本质区别，支撑它运转的技术（移动网络、云、CDN、推荐引擎）又是怎么回事。我希望你读完能用自己的话说清\"新\"在哪里。\n\n第二章进入内容生产与运营。这是大多数人最先接触、也最容易做出成果的环节。我们会拆解一条内容从选题到分发的完整流程，重点讲当下最主流的短视频与直播，以及\"私域\"这个被反复提及却常被误解的概念。\n\n第三章把视角拉到平台层面。抖音、小红书、视频号、B站，它们各自服务什么样的用户、遵循什么样的规则、如何治理违规内容、又如何让创作者赚到钱。理解平台，你才不会在规则变动时手足无措。\n\n第四章是我个人最着迷的部分：数据、算法与 AI 传播。我们会学习最基础的数据分析方法，揭开推荐算法\"召回—排序\"的神秘面纱，并直面 2026 年绕不开的话题——生成式 AI（AIGC）正在如何重塑内容的生产与分发。\n\n这套材料是写给\"从零开始的自学者\"的，不是学术讲义。我会尽量用我自己踩坑、观察、恍然大悟的视角来讲，配上可以动手验证的小练习。如果你也曾对着手机屏幕产生过好奇，那我们就从第一章开始吧。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intro-and-tech","title":"新媒体概论与技术基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/intro-and-tech","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-new-media","title":"到底什么是新媒体","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/intro-and-tech/what-is-new-media"},{"seq":2,"slug":"media-evolution-and-convergence","title":"媒介演化与融合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/intro-and-tech/media-evolution-and-convergence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"key-technologies","title":"支撑新媒体的关键技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/intro-and-tech/key-technologies"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-production","title":"内容生产与运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/content-production","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"content-creation-workflow","title":"内容生产的完整流程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/content-production/content-creation-workflow"},{"seq":2,"slug":"short-video-and-livestream","title":"短视频与直播","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/content-production/short-video-and-livestream"},{"seq":3,"slug":"community-and-private-domain","title":"私域与社群运营","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/content-production/community-and-private-domain"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-platforms","title":"社交媒体与平台生态","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/social-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-platform-landscape","title":"主流平台全景","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/social-platforms/social-platform-landscape"},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-rules-and-governance","title":"平台规则与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/social-platforms/platform-rules-and-governance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"creator-economy","title":"创作者经济","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/social-platforms/creator-economy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-and-ai","title":"数据、算法与AI传播","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/data-and-ai","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-analytics-basics","title":"数据分析基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/data-and-ai/data-analytics-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"recommendation-algorithms","title":"推荐算法揭秘","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/data-and-ai/recommendation-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-generated-content","title":"生成式 AI 与内容传播","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/new-media/data-and-ai/ai-generated-content"}]}]}